  "claims": [
    "Explicit PWCE configuration validates World, execution mode, sites, deployment and environment secret reference. Missing credentials yield unavailable status. PWCE selection cannot use standalone capability grants.",
    "Ordinary text and audio await bounded host-owned world preparation within the existing turn deadline. Authenticated host scope determines Assistant, endpoint, participants and audience. Unknown audience or missing endpoint sends no scoped read; clients cannot override world facts or capability state.",
    "Prepared prompt items retain qualifiers and source metadata as untrusted data. The independent byte budget omits whole records and reports omission/partial-result state, or withholds all facts if metadata cannot fit. The manifest binds the formatted content digest.",
    "Cache reuse/admission age and admitted snapshot validity are separate. Admitted generation may outlive cache reuse age but remains fenced by source validity, authority, owner scope, event epoch and wall/monotonic time. Profile replacement and shutdown close volatile world sessions.",
    "The separate-process synthetic test verifies an actual authenticated model request with two separate sites, replay mode, contradictory booleans, stale observations and matching prompt preview. A 1500ms generation survives cache age; audience withdrawal cancels subsequent output. A focused audio test verifies the same host world preparation and blocks invalidated text/PCM.",
    "No-op world preparation does not add an asynchronous pause to unselected ordinary turns. Existing deadline and cancellation tests pass."
  ],
